%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: GoodMonikaDepreMc
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Look, I'm just gonna cut straight to it-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999317
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I know about everything, including <b>them</b>.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999318
    - rid: 1790118444402999319
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: H-huh? Since when?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999320
    - rid: 1790118444402999323
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Since before you joined the literature club, actually.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999321
    - rid: 1790118444402999322
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Why didn't you say anything?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999324
    - rid: 1790118444402999325
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I actually tried to at first, but the thing that brought us here stopped
      me.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999326
    - rid: 1790118444402999328
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I just figured it wasn't worth it after a bit, especially since you didn't
      seem to know at the time.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>And</i> once we actually got here, I thought it wouldn't really be
      a good time to spill the beans-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999329
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: 'It''d be a bit much to be whisked into a whole different universe just
      to be told that: "no, no, no, the place we came from was all just a game too."'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999330
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But none of this is real! Why would it matter if we stayed in our convenient
      lie, you should've told us when you could!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999331
    - rid: 1790118444402999332
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999333
    - rid: 1790118444402999334
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That's because we might all be characters in a game, but we're still
      real.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999335
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: What does that even mean?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999336
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999337
    - rid: 1790118444402999339
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Would you say that the player is real?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118444402999340
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh... I guess, I can see them.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118469574328320
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah. I've had conversations with them before; unscripted ones.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118469574328321
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... so?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118469574328322
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So, if we're real from the perspective of a real person, doesn't that
      make us real people too?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118469574328323
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That's stupid.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118469574328324
    - rid: 1790118469574328325
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe a little, but that's how I've been thinking about it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: We can talk about it more if you want-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: But we should probably do it somewhere else.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118469574328326
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: It's too cold up here, ahaha!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118469574328327
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah... okay...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118469574328328
    - rid: 1790118469574328330
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But the others have a right to know.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118469574328329
    - rid: 1790118469574328331
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That's the hard part about things like this-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118469574328332
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: We aren't able to undo any unwanted revelations, we can't really get
      their consent for something this earth-shattering.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118469574328333
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118469574328334
    - rid: 1790118469574328335
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's just cross that bridge when we actually get there, okay?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118469574328336
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm think of heading to the inn in Riverwood, does that work for you,
      {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118469574328337
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... yeah, sure.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, then!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118469574328338
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The two start making their way to the Sleeping Giant inn.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118469574328339
    - rid: 1790118469574328340
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
